  "details": "When using VRChat.com, clicking on notes for a user erases the current contents, sometimes replacing it with contents from a different user (previously edited). I'd like to be able to edit already existing User Notes.\n\nExpected action: I click on the notes field, and the current contents remain, allowing for editing.\n\nCurrent behavior: If I have not touched any other user notes, clicking on the User Notes field will erase contents. If I have entered notes for another user, those notes will be substituted for the existing notes.",
